<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-switching-between-local-branches">
  <title>Switch Between Local Branches</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>switching branches</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>local branches</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_knw_kly_kpb">To switch between local branches from the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol>
      view, use the <uicontrol>Branch</uicontrol> combo box. You can also switch local branches from
      the <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager" format="dita"><uicontrol>Git
          Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref>.</p>
    <p id="p_lnw_kly_kpb">You can create new branches from the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager" format="dita"><uicontrol>Git
          Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref> or from the <uicontrol>History</uicontrol> table using
      the <uicontrol>Create branch</uicontrol> action in the contextual menu.</p>
  </body>
</topic>